<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="#">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">Access Control</span></div></div><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Markets we serve</div><h1 class="mk-h1">Access control electronics manufacturing</h1><p class="mk-lede">Hana manufactures RFID credentials and the electronic hardware they work with, from cards, fobs and inlays through to readers, locks and related access-control products. More than 20 years of RFID manufacturing experience is combined with PCBA, box build and final assembly within one manufacturing group.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#products" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Product examples</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><div class="mk-ph" style="aspect-ratio:auto;height:420px;border-bottom:0;"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ Access Control &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div></div></div><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-bottom:52px;"><div class="mk-strip"><span class="hana-spec-label" style="flex-shrink:0;">Product examples</span><div class="mk-chips"><span>Smart door locks</span><span>Access readers</span><span>Key cards &amp; fobs</span><span>Fingerprint locks</span><span>Hotel safes</span><span>Security tokens</span></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div style="max-width:760px;margin-bottom:34px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow on-dark">Why access-control buyers choose Hana</div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Credential and hardware manufacturing within one group</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:14px 0 0;">Hana manufactures both RFID credentials and the electronic hardware used with them. Our RFID operations have produced cards, tags and inlays for more than two decades, while our electronics manufacturing sites assemble readers, locks, safes and related products through to finished box build. Keeping these activities within one group can simplify supply-chain coordination, change control and production scaling. Qualified manufacturing across multiple countries also provides options for supply continuity and additional capacity.</p></div><div class="mk-points"><div class="pt"><div class="t">RFID manufacturing experience</div><p>More than 20 years of manufacturing cards, tags and inlays across LF, HF and UHF, supported by automated inlay production.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Electronic hardware and box build</div><p>Assembly of readers, keypads, fingerprint and BLE locks, safes and key deposits, including the miniature electronic assemblies used within them.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Multi-country manufacturing</div><p>Access-control manufacturing across China and Cambodia provides additional capacity and the option to qualify production at more than one Hana location.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="products" data-hana-bg="pcb" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:28px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">Product examples</h2></div><div class="mk-cards c2"><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/access-control/rfid-cards"><div class="mk-ph"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ Contactless access card and inlay &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div><div class="body"><div class="t">RFID Access Cards</div><p>Contactless cards, fobs and credentials across LF, HF and UHF, manufactured using automated inlay processes with encoding and personalization available to program requirements.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/access-control/smart-lock-assembly"><div class="mk-ph"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ Assembled smart lock on the line &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div><div class="body"><div class="t">Smart Lock &amp; Door Hardware</div><p>Box build of readers, keypads, fingerprint and BLE locks, safes and key deposits, including final product assembly and functional test.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:720px;margin-bottom:24px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">Footprint</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where we build</h2><p class="mk-body">Access-control manufacturing is supported by Hana sites in China and Cambodia, with additional RFID credential manufacturing in the USA. Programs can be qualified across more than one Hana location where additional capacity or supply continuity is required. See <a href="/locations">Locations</a> for plant-level detail.</p></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><div class="note">access readers &amp; cards, control boards for locks, RFID inlays</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/koh-kong"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Cambodia</span></span><div class="nm">Koh Kong</div><div class="note">reader box build, USB security tokens, final assembly</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ohio"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">USA</span></span><div class="nm">Ohio</div><div class="note">RFID inlays &amp; straps</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div></div></section><section style="background:#fff;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2><p class="mk-body">Common questions from access-control engineering and procurement teams.</p></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What does Hana build for access control?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana manufactures RFID access cards, fobs and other credentials, together with reader and lock hardware including keypads, fingerprint and BLE locks, safes and key deposits. Programs can therefore source both credentials and associated electronic hardware within the Hana group.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana make both the card and the lock?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Hana has manufactured RFID credentials for more than 20 years and also provides box build for the readers, locks and associated hardware used with them. This allows credential and hardware production to be coordinated within one manufacturing group.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Which sites serve access-control programs?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Access-control programs are supported by Jiaxing in China and Koh Kong in Cambodia, with additional RFID credential manufacturing in China and the USA.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Does Hana handle miniature and micro assemblies?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Access-control products frequently use compact PCBAs, sensor assemblies and other miniature electronic components. Hana supports these requirements through its broader microelectronics and electronics-assembly capabilities.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Start an access-control build program with Hana</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us about your product, manufacturing requirements and expected volumes. We can identify the appropriate Hana site and process route for your program.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section>